{"id":23018,"name":"片刻，留在眼底","rarity":5,"path":"Mage","desc":"智识命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"他曾听闻歌谣，传唱那道光芒：\\n玫瑰盛放，定是为了回应祂的笑容；\\n晨光烁耀，定是为了照亮祂的脸庞；\\n音律奏鸣，定是为了唤醒祂的倦眸。\\n\\n但那光芒一去不复返，他仍奔向远方\\n——只须等待，只须信仰，只须将纯美的一切播撒于寰宇。\\n即使一切都只是留在眼底的片刻，他却已收获想要的答案。","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23018,"name":"骑士巡礼","desc":"使装备者的暴击伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>。当装备者施放终结技时，根据装备者的能量上限，提高装备者终结技造成的伤害：每点能量提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[f2]%</unbreak></color>，最多计入<unbreak>#3[i]</unbreak>点。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.36,0.0036000002,180]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.42,0.0042,180]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.48,0.0048,180]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.54,0.0054,180]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.6,0.0059999996,180]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":48,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":26.4,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":21,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":111001,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":105.6,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":58.08,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":46.2,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110131,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":111001,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":182.4,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":100.32,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":79.8,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110132,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":111002,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":259.2,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":142.56,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":113.4,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110132,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":111002,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":336,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":184.8,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":147,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":100000},{"ItemID":110133,"ItemNum":5},{"ItemID":111003,"ItemNum":6}]},"5":{"hp_base":412.8,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":227.04,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":180.6,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":70,"cost"